Site prose and graphics use the content grant above, not this software grant.

## Exclusions and existing rights

Existing file-specific licenses, attribution and third-party notices take
precedence for the material they identify. Third-party quotations (including
Bible translations), images, dependencies, fonts and copied source material
remain subject to their owners' terms; their inclusion grants no new rights.
Links to other repositories or sites do not relicense their contents.

Drafts, unpublished/staged material, private correspondence, coordination
records, `04-work-packages/`, `05-mxm-construct/memory/` and root `MEMORY.md`
are outside these grants unless separately and explicitly licensed.
Other material not expressly included above is also outside these grants.
Trademark, privacy and publicity rights are not granted; reuse must not imply
endorsement. No exclusive copyright is asserted over public-domain material.

